    "description": "HOW TO OPEN: long-press the settings gear on your profile tab. — This adds a \"Letterboxd Mods\" screen that collects the other patches' options (theme, accent, hide ratings, hide video store, hide where to watch, open in player, match bottom nav, etc.) so you can change them inside the app instead of re-patching. Some changes apply immediately, others after a restart, and you'll be prompted either way.",
